re and tenant for per-unit cost attribution\n2. Route simple tasks to small models using a trained classifier or heuristics\n3. Cache exact and semantic matches; measure hit-rate weekly\n4. Compress context: prune, summarize history, cap tool outputs\n5. Set per-key and per-tenant daily caps with graceful degradation paths\n6. Review the top ten most expensive prompts monthly and shrink them\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Premium model answering 'is this email spam?'\n- Semantic caches keyed too loosely, returning stale answers\n"}]}]]}],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://github.com/aniruddhaadak80/skills/blob/main/skills/inference-mlops-llm-cost-controls/SKILL.md","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"block text-center px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-white/15 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors","children":"View source on GitHub ↗"}]]}]]}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"mt-16 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/skills/ai-engineering/inference-mlops-latency-budgeting","className":"card-hover group rounded-xl border border-white/[0.07] bg-panel/70 p-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600","children":"← Previous"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300 group-hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors truncate","children":"Budget LLM latency end to end"}]]}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/skills/ai-engineering/inference-mlops-prompt-injection-defense","className":"card-hover group rounded-xl border border-white/[0.07] bg-panel/70 p-4 text-right","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600","children":"Next →"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300 group-hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors truncate","children":"Defend pipelines against prompt injection"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-14 pb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"class